      "y": 408.22265625,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Best of both worlds:\n• No duplicates ✓\n• No blocking ✓\n• No deadlock risk ✓\n• Workers fully parallel ✓\n• Throughput scales with workers ✓\n\nVerdict: CORRECT + SCALABLE",
      "originalText": "Best of both worlds:\n• No duplicates ✓\n• No blocking ✓\n• No deadlock risk ✓\n• Workers fully parallel ✓\n• Throughput scales with workers ✓\n\nVerdict: CORRECT + SCALABLE",
